{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/AfricaFactsZone/posts/worlds-highest-number-of-people-living-in-extreme-poverty-2026-1-nigeria-731-mil/1643931547400275/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/AfricaFactsZone/posts/worlds-highest-number-of-people-living-in-extreme-poverty-2026-1-nigeria-731-mil/1643931547400275/","title":"Africa Facts Zone","description":"World's Highest Number of People Living in Extreme Poverty (2026)\n\n1. Nigeria 🇳🇬 - 73.1 million\n\n2. DR Congo 🇨🇩 - 71.6 million\n\n3. Afghanistan 🇦🇫 - 35.2 million\n\n4. Mozambique 🇲🇿 - 25 million\n\n5....","language":"en","text":"World's Highest Number of People Living in Extreme Poverty (2026)\n\n1. Nigeria - 73.1 million\n\n2. DR Congo - 71.6 million\n\n3. Afghanistan - 35.2 million\n\n4. Mozambique - 25 million\n\n5. Yemen - 24.2 million\n\n6. Tanzania - 23.9 million\n\n7. Madagascar - 20.1 million\n\n8. Uganda - 18.2 million\n\n9. India - 14.46 million\n\n10. Ethiopia - 14.3 million\n\nSource: World Data Lab.\n\nAll reactions:\n\n911 comments\n\n124 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nVuyane Mogane\n\nAnd guess what? Zimbabwe is not on the list\n\n, our neighbors are doing better\n\n90\n\nView all 37 replies\n\nVictor Lorr Murry\n\nAt least it's poverty not HIV\n\n49\n\nView all 73 replies\n\nShadrack Okpomeh\n\nHahahahaha it's funny this south Africa admin is really doing a good job\n\n18\n\nView all 17 replies\n\nAmazing Grace\n\nI'm an economics professor\n\nThis is incorrect\n\n52\n\nView all 27 replies\n\nAhmed Sadiya Oyiza\n\nDepends on what you term as extreme poverty because I as a Nigerian am not rich but I don't live in extreme poverty\n\n13\n\nView all 15 replies\n\nPageant Aesthetics NG\n\nHow?\n\nIndia alone have 1.4+ billion people and Nigeria 270 million. So how?\n\n9\n\nView all 28 replies\n\nMshayi Mshayi\n\nNow I understand why they eat dogs\n\n97\n\nView all 2 replies\n\nAndile Noguda\n\nAt least they have Dangothe and Osimhen with Tibunu as president..Investors!\n\n29\n\nTop fan\n\n73 million? That’s the population of South Africa, Botswana, Swaziland & Lesotho combined. What’s actually happening in Nigeria?\n\n17\n\nView all 12 replies\n\nNadia Mchunu\n\nI saw Nigerians scoping oil on the ground i was like woh life is not easy that side no wonder most of them have anger issues.\n\n7","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2563.710820999404,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}